WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.000
Brother-in-law, be careful.

00:07.040 --> 00:09.280
Return to camp and organize troops attack the city.

00:09.680 --> 00:11.080
Retreat.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.500
Xie Xuan led troops in a fierce assault for two days, yet Dongming City never fell.

00:17.240 --> 00:21.840
Can't delay any longer dongming has long resisted attack qingzhou Army presses from behind.

00:22.520 --> 00:28.120
I've discovered someone is communicating with the court wanting to defect to protect their families.

00:28.320 --> 00:33.160
If this continues morale will be in danger one day.

00:33.240 --> 00:37.720
Give me one more day I'll personally lead the battle will surely take the city.

00:37.800 --> 00:41.680
Dongming is now impregnable Your reckless bravery.

00:41.760 --> 00:44.240
Will only cause heavy losses.

00:47.520 --> 00:52.440
Your Highness it's the rainy season now Tianhe water level has surged.

00:52.640 --> 00:57.000
If we breach the Nanshui dike and flood the city.

00:57.120 --> 01:02.400
Then Dongming within one day will fall Father breaching the dike.

01:02.560 --> 01:06.240
In this city and tens of thousands of surrounding people, will they survive?

01:06.320 --> 01:09.720
They are all Xuan's subjects they are innocent.

01:11.960 --> 01:17.920
Child remember to achieve great things some sacrifice.

01:18.600 --> 01:23.880
Is unavoidable even if we don't care about those people's lives.

01:24.240 --> 01:26.720
We must still consider Your Highness's reputation.

01:30.440 --> 01:35.120
Say no more since Your Highness raised troops at Yiyang we.

01:35.200 --> 01:38.280
Have already been rebels in the historians' records.

01:40.400 --> 01:43.040
Your Highness make a decision.

